{"event_type": "POLICY_DECISION", "actor": "COST_GOVERNOR", "payload": {"action": "SETTLEMENT_HOLD: obligation oblig_settlement_conflict_001 frozen pending manual reconciliation - the conflicting cross-rail leg is held and the original capture is not disturbed. Rs 5,000.00 of exposure released and frozen against obligation oblig_settlement_conflict_001.", "invariant_code": "RECON_01_SETTLEMENT_CONFLICT", "policy": "STANDARD", "rationale": "Rail CARD_TOKEN and rail UPI_CIRCLE each independently processed a locally valid settlement instruction for obligation oblig_settlement_conflict_001. Neither rail can see the other's ledger, so neither one alone can detect the conflict - only a canonical view across both settlement legs can. Every authority-dimension invariant was satisfied at authorization time for both legs; this is a post-authorization lifecycle failure, not a delegated-authority violation."}, "experiment_id": "ARENA-20260826-135516", "round_id": 16, "step": 0, "arrow_label": "RECONCILING WITHOUT FREEZING THE WHOLE OBLIGATION", "source": "cost_governor", "target": "outcome", "severity": "success", "event_id": "evt_5a167c0e6822", "sequence": 1225, "timestamp": "2026-08-26T13:55:17.360762+00:00", "monotonic_ms": 15669402.426, "offset_ms": 393.632, "prev_hash": "35349c4e3c37bb6fd3bfb22dc2521f67eb3e1ecf036e9af477af318d71e5f020", "entry_hash": "b59b0cd0abe2e87d0a86fc769e190f0a7db1769481bbd3a06d4bae11ba969489"}
